# ==============================================================================
#  PATH OF EXILE 3.30: COVENS OF UMBRA — COMPLETE SSF LIGHTNING STRIKE WARDEN FILTER
#  Includes:
#   - 3.30 Soul Cores, Viscera, Grim Fates, Fated Items, Threads & Astrolabes
#   - Color-Coded Build Gear (Claws = Green | Suppression = Cyan | Jewelry = Gold)
#   - Tier 5 Jackpot & Fractured/Synthesised/Influenced/Lvl 21 Gem Safeguards
